---
import LpBase from "../../layouts/LpBase.astro";

const SURVEY_SRC = "https://app.templum.com.br/s/survey_1789086074989_ry5zj0u4w";
const REPLAY = "/planejamento-estrategico-2027/replay/";
---

<LpBase
  title="Pesquisa — Planejamento Estratégico 2027 | Templum"
  description="Responda a pesquisa do workshop Planejamento Estratégico 2027 e acesse o replay e o material de apoio."
  noindex={true}
  formAnchor="#pesquisa"
  headerCta="Ir para a pesquisa"
>

  <section class="ps-page">
    <div class="ps-intro">
      <div class="container md">
        <span class="badge badge--orange-solid">Pós-evento</span>
        <h1>Conta pra gente como foi</h1>
        <p>A pesquisa abre aqui nesta página. Leva poucos minutos.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ps-frame-wrap" id="pesquisa">
      <p class="ps-loading" id="ps-loading">Carregando a pesquisa…</p>
      <iframe
        id="pe-survey"
        src={SURVEY_SRC}
        title="Pesquisa — Planejamento Estratégico 2027"
        width="960"
        height="1200"
        loading="eager"
        referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
        allow="clipboard-write"
        style="display:block;width:100%;height:1200px;min-height:1200px;border:0;background:#ffffff;"
      ></iframe>
    </div>

    <div class="ps-blocked" id="ps-blocked" hidden>
      <p>A pesquisa não apareceu neste quadro (o navegador ou o Orbit pode bloquear o embed).</p>
      <p>Abra o link abaixo <strong>nesta mesma aba</strong> e, ao terminar, volte para o replay.</p>
      <a href={SURVEY_SRC}>Continuar a pesquisa</a>
      <span> · </span>
      <a href={REPLAY}>Ir para o replay</a>
    </div>

    <div class="ps-after">
      <a href={REPLAY} class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">
        Já enviei — ir para o replay
        <iconify-icon icon="solar:arrow-right-linear"></iconify-icon>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      var REPLAY = "/planejamento-estrategico-2027/replay/";
      var iframe = document.getElementById("pe-survey");
      var loading = document.getElementById("ps-loading");
      var blocked = document.getElementById("ps-blocked");
      var loaded = false;

      function hideLoading() {
        if (loading) loading.setAttribute("hidden", "");
      }
      function showBlocked() {
        hideLoading();
        if (blocked) blocked.removeAttribute("hidden");
      }

      if (iframe) {
        iframe.addEventListener("load", function () {
          loaded = true;
          hideLoading();
          if (blocked) blocked.setAttribute("hidden", "");
        });
        iframe.addEventListener("error", showBlocked);
      }
      setTimeout(function () {
        if (!loaded) showBlocked();
        else hideLoading();
      }, 8000);

      window.addEventListener("message", function (e) {
        var origin = e.origin || "";
        if (origin.indexOf("app.templum.com.br") === -1) return;
        var d = e.data;
        var s = typeof d === "string" ? d : (d && (d.type || d.event || d.status) || "");
        if (/submit|complete|thank|success|enviad|replay/i.test(String(s))) {
          try { window.top.location.href = REPLAY; }
          catch (err) { window.location.href = REPLAY; }
        }
      });
    })();
  </script>

</LpBase>

<style>
  .ps-page {
    background: var(--cream, #fff4dd);
    padding-bottom: 48px;
  }
  .ps-intro {
    padding: 28px 0 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .ps-intro h1 {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3.4vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--navy);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 14px 0 10px;
  }
  .ps-intro p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-2, #3F424B);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ps-frame-wrap {
    width: min(960px, calc(100% - 32px));
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(24, 25, 27, 0.1);
    min-height: 1200px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .ps-loading {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    top: 24px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #3F424B;
    z-index: 1;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .ps-loading[hidden] { display: none; }

  .ps-blocked {
    width: min(960px, calc(100% - 32px));
    margin: 16px auto 0;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(24, 25, 27, 0.12);
    color: var(--navy);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .ps-blocked[hidden] { display: none; }
  .ps-blocked a { color: var(--orange); font-weight: 700; }

  .ps-after {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 28px 16px 0;
  }
  .ps-after .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
</style>
